| `src/ui/non_interactive.rs` | No changes needed (defaults are fine). |
| `src/ui/mock.rs` | No changes needed (defaults are fine). |
| `src/runner/workflow.rs` | Remove `BivvyTheme` and `live_output_callback` imports. Replace all theme usage with trait method calls. Replace `progress_bar()` usage with `create_output_callback()`. |

